able, add basic tests for:\n  - `greet`\n  - math helpers\n  - `fizzbuzz(15)`\n\nExample cleaned-up version:\n\n```python\ndef greet(name: str, greeting: str = \"Hello\") -> str:\n    \"\"\"Return a greeting for the given name.\"\"\"\n    return f\"{greeting}, {name}!\"\n\n\ndef add(a: int | float, b: int | float) -> int | float:\n    \"\"\"Return the sum of two numbers.\"\"\"\n    return a + b\n\n\ndef multiply(a: int | float, b: int | float) -> int | float:\n    \"\"\"Return the product of two numbers.\"\"\"\n    return a * b\n\n\ndef fizzbuzz(n: int) -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"Return the FizzBuzz sequence from 1 to n.\"\"\"\n    if n < 1:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be >= 1\")\n\n    results = []\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        if i % 15 == 0:\n            results.append(\"FizzBuzz\")\n        elif i % 3 == 0:\n            results.append(\"Fizz\")\n        elif i % 5 == 0:\n            results.append(\"Buzz\")\n        else:\n            results.append(str(i))\n    return results\n```\n\nIf you want, I can also rewrite `hello.py` with these improvements.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d45a70bbb1112750169e82b67abf48191840ad1b8baf6aa6c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":362,"output":494,"cacheRead":10240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11096,"cost":{"input":0.0009050000000000001,"output":0.00741,"cacheRead":0.0025599999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010875}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776823141498,"responseId":"resp_0d45a70bbb1112750169e82b65a9048191bf21c576a8d8dd00"}}
